  "description": "Downloads DATASUS files from its public FTP server and opens them with DbSus: listing, split-table discovery, resumable downloads with retries, and an optional local cache. It has a catalog of 112 DATASUS file types, to find, list and open tables by dataset, state and period. Independent project, not affiliated with the Brazilian Ministry of Health or DATASUS.",
